      "writtenOn": "2026-04-23T05:50:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know what the future holds. I thought Vulkan allowed encoding multiple command buffers concurrently and Dawn eventually wanted to support that. It\u0027s also in the bug report that this is an issue. I\u0027ll remove it for now.",
      "parentUuid": "5556598c_a3d91675",
      "revId": "398f499709cec476147eb6d2261ce01ceab7f2bf",
