        "id": 1003446
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-23T05:50:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I implemented this. except, I\u0027m not quite sure about \u0027...and SetQueryAvailability(false) for the resolved queries.\"  My understanding it queries stay available forever. In fact I believe we have tests that resolving them more than once works and keeps the same result:\n\nhttps://github.com/gpuweb/cts/blob/5234d6547f05ba0d968f9690e2424e0ac933dc67/src/webgpu/api/operation/command_buffer/queries/occlusionQuery.spec.ts#L1068\n\nI just added the timestamp ones here: https://github.com/gpuweb/cts/pull/4631",
      "parentUuid": "a7cd31af_859a19c6",
